	)
	(text_box "@{\"Id\":\"PNZACEDM\\IYQRDTBT\",\"ObjectType\":2} is film because the high-impedance low-voltage signal is more sensitive to microphonics.\n100nF & ~\nMΩ ( @{\"Id\":\"PVVUFJBL\\JFKFHGTY\",\"ObjectType\":2} OPAMP Zin & @{\"Id\":\"PNZACEDM\\FIJOSKNR\",\"ObjectType\":2} ) gives 1.59Hz cut-off frequency."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 83.82 113.03 0)
		(size -50.8 17.78)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
